    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d98-a1">

                <pb facs="0269" n="1229" xml:id="pg1229"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 141.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mariscal to Mr.
                            Bragg.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-09-13"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 13,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: I have the honor to answer your
                    excellency’s note of the 1st instant relative to the extradition of Gulie
                    Shields and Isaac Wilson, advising you that I have requested the governor of the
                    State of Coahuila to secure the arrest of said parties, in order to deliver
                    them, when requisition is made for them, in accordance with the extradition
                    treaty.</p>
                <p>I renew, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Igno. Mariscal.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
